  "description": "By winning the final stage of the legendary Cape Epic, the new Wild Edge has impressively demonstrated its performance. Developed in collaboration with Team BULLS, the race bike from our pros offers you a completely redesigned carbon frame, an innovative suspension concept and uncompromising equipment down to the last detail. Thanks to the 4-link swing arm, the rear suspension impresses with optimum performance on descents and maximum stiffness and efficiency on climbs. This is supported by a slightly steeper seat angle, which was optimised in close consultation with the team pros, as well as a particularly low centre of gravity. With 120 mm of travel, the Wild Edge is perfectly equipped for all cross-country and downcountry challenges. The high-performance components from the new Bike Parts Rumble line - from the carbon handlebar stem unit to the dropper post - also fit seamlessly into the overall concept. The aim: maximum performance in tough racing conditions.",
